WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.016
Let's connect a Slack

00:00:02.016 --> 00:00:03.206
app to Recatch.

00:00:03.506 --> 00:00:05.268
Step one. Create your

00:00:05.268 --> 00:00:07.448
account at recatch.app.

00:00:07.518 --> 00:00:09.355
On the Create your workspace

00:00:09.355 --> 00:00:11.257
screen, enter your name, your

00:00:11.257 --> 00:00:12.832
email, and a password of

00:00:12.832 --> 00:00:14.525
at least 8 characters.

00:00:14.595 --> 00:00:16.078
Then click Create account.

00:00:16.378 --> 00:00:17.391
Step two. You land

00:00:17.391 --> 00:00:18.936
on the Channels screen.

00:00:19.006 --> 00:00:21.353
Under Connect a channel, click Slack.

00:00:21.423 --> 00:00:22.889
If you see Add to Slack,

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:25.149
that's the one-click option. To paste

00:00:25.149 --> 00:00:27.103
tokens instead, click Use my own

00:00:27.103 --> 00:00:28.453
Slack app instead.

00:00:28.753 --> 00:00:32.379
Step three. At api.slack.com/apps,

00:00:32.379 --> 00:00:34.123
create an app.

00:00:34.193 --> 00:00:36.503
Under OAuth and Permissions, add

00:00:36.503 --> 00:00:39.246
the bot scopes chat:write, im:history,

00:00:39.246 --> 00:00:41.879
im:read, im:write and users:read.

00:00:41.949 --> 00:00:44.111
Install it to your workspace, and

00:00:44.111 --> 00:00:46.077
copy the Bot User OAuth Token,

00:00:46.077 --> 00:00:47.900
which starts with xoxb-.

00:00:47.970 --> 00:00:49.847
Then copy the Signing Secret

00:00:49.847 --> 00:00:52.059
from Basic Information. These are

00:00:52.059 --> 00:00:54.137
fake examples. Never share your

00:00:54.137 --> 00:00:55.794
real token or secret.

00:00:56.094 --> 00:00:58.045
Step four. Paste the Bot User

00:00:58.045 --> 00:01:00.650
OAuth Token and the Signing secret.

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:03.005
Step five. Click Connect app.

00:01:03.305 --> 00:01:05.630
Recatch now shows a Request URL,

00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:08.132
under Paste into the Slack app.

00:01:08.432 --> 00:01:10.034
Step six. Paste it into

00:01:10.034 --> 00:01:12.610
Event Subscriptions, and subscribe to

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:14.601
the bot event message.im.

00:01:14.671 --> 00:01:16.432
Paste it into Interactivity

00:01:16.432 --> 00:01:17.855
and Shortcuts too.

00:01:17.925 --> 00:01:19.320
Under App Home, turn on

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:20.958
the Messages tab, and leave

00:01:20.958 --> 00:01:22.179
Socket Mode off.

00:01:22.479 --> 00:01:24.661
That's it. Slack is connected.

00:01:24.731 --> 00:01:26.483
Next, build your first flow,

00:01:26.483 --> 00:01:28.549
from the lead-capture template or

00:01:28.549 --> 00:01:29.737
a blank canvas.
